# Crafting Addon Interactions

## Purpose
Integration patterns for crafting-related addon interactions in SND macros.

## Scope
This rule covers crafting addon interactions, UI manipulation, and crafting state management.

## Basic Crafting Addon Patterns

### RecipeNote Addon
```lua
-- Check if RecipeNote addon is ready
function IsRecipeNoteReady()
    return Addons.GetAddon("RecipeNote").Ready
end

-- Open RecipeNote
function OpenRecipeNote()
    if IsRecipeNoteReady() then
        CallbackAddon("RecipeNote", "OpenRecipeNote")
        return true
    end
    return false
end

-- Close RecipeNote
function CloseRecipeNote()
    if IsRecipeNoteReady() then
        CallbackAddon("RecipeNote", "CloseRecipeNote")
        return true
    end
    return false
end
```

### Synthesis Addon
```lua
-- Check if Synthesis addon is ready
function IsSynthesisReady()
    return Addons.GetAddon("Synthesis").Ready
end

-- Start synthesis
function StartSynthesis()
    if IsSynthesisReady() then
        CallbackAddon("Synthesis", "StartSynthesis")
        return true
    end
    return false
end

-- Check synthesis status
function IsSynthesisActive()
    if IsSynthesisReady() then
        return CallbackAddon("Synthesis", "IsActive")
    end
    return false
end
```

## Advanced Crafting Addon Patterns

### Crafting Addon State Management
```lua
-- Check crafting addon states
function GetCraftingAddonStatus()
    local status = {
        recipeNote = IsRecipeNoteReady(),
        synthesis = IsSynthesisReady()
    }
    return status
end

-- Wait for crafting addon to be ready
function WaitForCraftingAddonReady(addonName, timeout)
    timeout = timeout or 10
    local startTime = os.clock()
    
    while not Addons.GetAddon(addonName).Ready and (os.clock() - startTime) < timeout do
        yield("/wait 0.1")
    end
    
    return Addons.GetAddon(addonName).Ready
end
```

### Crafting Addon Error Handling
```lua
-- Safe crafting addon callback
function SafeCraftingAddonCallback(addonName, functionName, ...)
    if not Addons.GetAddon(addonName).Ready then
        yield("/echo [Script] Addon not ready: " .. addonName)
        return false
    end
    
    local success, result = pcall(function()
        return CallbackAddon(addonName, functionName, ...)
    end)
    
    if not success then
        yield("/echo [Script] Addon callback failed: " .. tostring(result))
        return false
    end
    
    return result
end
```

## Crafting Workflow Integration

### Complete Crafting Workflow
```lua
-- Complete crafting workflow with addon integration
function CompleteCraftingWorkflow(recipeId, quantity, timeout)
    timeout = timeout or 300
    
    -- Check prerequisites
    if not IsRecipeNoteReady() then
        yield("/echo [Script] ERROR: RecipeNote addon not ready")
        return false
    end
    
    if not IsSynthesisReady() then
        yield("/echo [Script] ERROR: Synthesis addon not ready")
        return false
    end
    
    -- Open RecipeNote
    if not OpenRecipeNote() then
        yield("/echo [Script] ERROR: Failed to open RecipeNote")
        return false
    end
    
    -- Wait for RecipeNote to open
    yield("/wait 1")
    
    -- Start synthesis
    if not StartSynthesis() then
        yield("/echo [Script] ERROR: Failed to start synthesis")
        return false
    end
    
    -- Wait for synthesis to complete
    local startTime = os.clock()
    while IsSynthesisActive() and (os.clock() - startTime) < timeout do
        yield("/wait 1")
    end
    
    if IsSynthesisActive() then
        yield("/echo [Script] WARNING: Synthesis timeout")
        return false
    end
    
    -- Close RecipeNote
    CloseRecipeNote()
    
    yield("/echo [Script] Crafting completed successfully")
    return true
end
```

## State Machine Integration

### Crafting State Pattern
```lua
-- Add crafting state to your state machine
CharacterState = {
    ready = Ready,
    openingRecipeNote = OpeningRecipeNote,
    crafting = Crafting,
    -- ... other states
}

function OpeningRecipeNote()
    if OpenRecipeNote() then
        yield("/echo [Script] RecipeNote opened")
        State = CharacterState.crafting
    else
        yield("/echo [Script] Failed to open RecipeNote")
        State = CharacterState.ready
    end
end

function Crafting()
    if CompleteCraftingWorkflow(recipeId, quantity, 300) then
        yield("/echo [Script] Crafting completed")
        State = CharacterState.ready
    else
        yield("/echo [Script] Crafting failed")
        State = CharacterState.ready
    end
end
```

## Configuration Integration

### Crafting Addon Configuration Variables
```lua
-- Add to your macro's configs section
configs:
  EnableCraftingAddons:
    default: true
    description: Enable crafting addon interactions
  CraftingTimeout:
    default: 300
    description: Crafting timeout in seconds
  AddonWaitTimeout:
    default: 10
    description: Addon wait timeout in seconds
```

### Usage in Code
```lua
-- Get configuration values
local enableCraftingAddons = Config.Get("EnableCraftingAddons") == "true"
local craftingTimeout = tonumber(Config.Get("CraftingTimeout"))
local addonWaitTimeout = tonumber(Config.Get("AddonWaitTimeout"))

-- Use in crafting logic
if enableCraftingAddons then
    if not CompleteCraftingWorkflow(recipeId, quantity, craftingTimeout) then
        yield("/echo [Script] Crafting failed")
        return false
    end
end
```

## Best Practices

### 1. Always Check Addon Readiness
```lua
-- Check addon readiness before use
if not IsRecipeNoteReady() then
    yield("/echo [Script] RecipeNote not ready")
    return false
end
```

### 2. Use Timeouts for Addon Operations
```lua
-- Use timeouts for addon operations
if not WaitForCraftingAddonReady("RecipeNote", 10) then
    yield("/echo [Script] RecipeNote timeout")
    return false
end
```

### 3. Handle Addon Errors
```lua
-- Handle addon errors gracefully
if not SafeCraftingAddonCallback("RecipeNote", "OpenRecipeNote") then
    yield("/echo [Script] Failed to open RecipeNote")
    return false
end
```

### 4. Use Appropriate Wait Times
```lua
-- Use appropriate wait times for addon operations
yield("/wait 1") -- Wait for addon to respond
```

### 5. Monitor Addon States
```lua
-- Monitor addon states
local status = GetCraftingAddonStatus()
if status.recipeNote and status.synthesis then
    yield("/echo [Script] All crafting addons ready")
end
```

